**Scopes are not yet assigned.** The structure below is in place and ready; the missions and owned
paths get filled in once the three of you decide who takes what. Until then, coordinate every
non-trivial edit through `IN-FLIGHT.md` — with no ownership map, that board is the only thing
preventing collisions.

